{"id":18875,"date":"2025-03-18T16:54:06","date_gmt":"2025-03-18T16:54:06","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/?page_id=18875"},"modified":"2025-03-18T16:54:06","modified_gmt":"2025-03-18T16:54:06","slug":"jacky-t","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/jacky-t\/","title":{"rendered":"Jacky T."},"content":{"rendered":"<h3><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft size-thumbnail wp-image-18876\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/FUN-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/FUN-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/FUN-400x400.jpg 400w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/FUN-600x600.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/>DJ Jacky T.<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>Born and raised in Atlanta, DJ Jacky T. is an all-around entertainer with a passion for bringing energy to every event. He started DJing in 2023, but his experience in collegiate events and lively gatherings has shaped him into a natural crowd controller. Whether it\u2019s a packed house party or a high-energy club night, Jacky T. knows how to set the vibe and keep the party going.<\/p>\n<p>In his headphones, you\u2019ll find a diverse mix of\u00a0<strong>80s and 90s classics, soft rock, early 2000s rap and R&amp;B, late 2010s emo rap, and the golden era of 2010s EDM<\/strong>\u2014a perfect blend for any crowd. For him, the best part of DJing is simple:\u00a0<strong>getting paid to have fun and play music<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>Beyond DJing, Jacky T. is a\u00a0<strong>recording studio owner and sound engineer<\/strong>, helping artists bring their music to life. He\u2019s also a talented\u00a0<strong>actor and model<\/strong>, with a love for cinema that fuels his creativity. Whether he\u2019s behind the decks, in the studio, or on set, he thrives on artistic expression.<\/p>\n<p>With skills in\u00a0<strong>singing, dancing, comedy, and undeniable charm<\/strong>, DJ Jacky T. is more than just a DJ\u2014he\u2019s a full-fledged entertainer ready to turn any event into an unforgettable experience<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>DJ Jacky T. Born and raised in Atlanta, DJ Jacky T. is an all-around entertainer with a passion for bringing energy to every event. He started DJing in 2023, but his experience in collegiate events and lively gatherings has shaped him into a natural crowd controller. Whether it\u2019s a packed house party or a high-energy&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-18875","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.7 (Yoast SEO v26.7) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Jacky T. - JAMMIN&#039; DJs Georgia &amp; Tennessee<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/jacky-t\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Jacky T.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"DJ Jacky T. Born and raised in Atlanta, DJ Jacky T. is an all-around entertainer with a passion for bringing energy to every event. He started DJing in 2023, but his experience in collegiate events and lively gatherings has shaped him into a natural crowd controller. Whether it\u2019s a packed house party or a high-energy&hellip;\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/jacky-t\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"JAMMIN&#039; DJs Georgia &amp; Tennessee\" \/>\n<